Assertions:
[COUNT] W_N equals W_FIRST and the W_CODES are the first W_N of API_W, compared without regard to case -- the widget shows exactly the head of the list it asked for {SPEC}
[REL] LINK_HREF ends with /company/my-customers/<the customer id>/coupons and PAGE_URL is the same path {SPEC}
[DOM] H1 reads 'Promotion coupons for ' followed by the customer name {SPEC}
[REL] CRUMBS read Account, Sales Rep hub, My customers, the customer name, Promotion coupons, in that order {SPEC}
[COUNT] P_N is 10, P_FIRST is 10 and P_AFTER is 0, and P_CODES are API_P compared without regard to case -- the page shows the first ten of the list {SPEC}
[REL] the first W_N of P_CODES equal W_CODES -- the widget and the page agree on the head of the list {SPEC}
[REL] PASTED equals CARD3 compared without regard to case -- the clipboard holds the code of the card that was clicked {SPEC}
[NETWORK] no 4xx/5xx on /graphql/sales-rep and no GraphQL errors[] in any salesRepCoupons response during the case {SPEC}

[COUNT] MAX is above 0 and USED is above 0 and below MAX -- the precondition: a capped coupon with a partial count {OBSERVED}
[REL] USES_CAPPED equals the number MAX minus USED, then 'uses left out of', then MAX (for example '3 uses left out of 5') -- the left count comes from the fresh recount, not from the cap {SPEC}
[DOM] USES_UNCAPPED reads 'Unlimited' {SPEC}
[NETWORK] no 4xx/5xx on /graphql/sales-rep and no GraphQL errors[] in any salesRepCoupons response during the case {SPEC}

[COUNT] MAX minus USED is 1 -- the precondition: exactly one use is left {OBSERVED}
[REL] USES_ONE reads '1 use left out of ' followed by MAX, with 'use' in the singular {SPEC}
[COUNT] ZERO_LINES is empty -- no card on any page says 0 uses are left {SPEC}
[REL] every line in ONE_LINES says '1 use left', never '1 uses left' {SPEC}
[NETWORK] no 4xx/5xx on /graphql/sales-rep and no GraphQL errors[] in any salesRepCoupons response during the case {SPEC}

[REL] UNDATED_EXPIRES is false -- a coupon with no end date shows no Expires line {SPEC}
[REL] in LAST_PAGE_ROWS, once a card without an Expires line appears every later card on that page also has none -- coupons without an end date come last {SPEC}
[COUNT] no entry of ALL_EXPIRES is empty and none reads a date in 1970 or 1969 {SPEC}
[NETWORK] no 4xx/5xx on /graphql/sales-rep and no GraphQL errors[] in any salesRepCoupons response during the case {SPEC}

[REL] COUPONS_NF equals PROFILE_NF -- the same not-found state the profile gives for this organization {SPEC}
[REL] H1 is the fallback 'Promotion coupons' without a customer name and NAME_SHOWN is false {BL}
[COUNT] CARDS_N is 0 -- no store coupons are framed as belonging to a customer the rep has no access to {BL}
[REL] CRUMBS hold no customer segment {SPEC}

[REL] FINAL_URL equals {{FRONT_URL}}/account/dashboard -- the guard sends a non-rep home {OBSERVED}
[REL] RAIL_SEEN is false -- no part of the rep's coupon tool rendered {BL}
[COUNT] SR_REQS is 0 -- no rep data was fetched and discarded {BL}
[STATE] the 'Sales Rep hub' rail section is absent from the left navigation {BL}

[REL] N_DEFAULT equals FIRST_DEFAULT and is at most 5 -- the default row setting {SPEC}
[REL] N_SAVED is 3 and FIRST_SAVED is 3 -- the saved setting is the number of cards and the number asked of the API {SPEC}
[REL] WIDGET_AFTER_HIDE is false {SPEC}
[COUNT] COUPON_REQS_HIDDEN is 0 -- a hidden widget does not query {BL}
[NETWORK] no 4xx/5xx on /graphql/sales-rep and no GraphQL errors[] in any salesRepCoupons response during the case {SPEC}

[COUNT] TOTAL_1 modulo 10 is 1 and the last page held one card before the delete -- the precondition {OBSERVED}
[COUNT] CARDS_AFTER is above 0 -- the rep never sits on an empty page of a list that still has coupons {SPEC}
[REL] PAGES_AFTER shows one page fewer than PAGES_BEFORE, or the page was already one page fewer when the rep returned -- the pager reflects the smaller total {HYPOTHESIS}

[REL] SKELETON_N equals the number of cards the loaded page then shows -- the placeholders have the shape of the rows about to arrive {SPEC}
[REL] SKELETON_HIDDEN is true and STATUS_LOADING is empty -- the loading placeholders are not announced as content {BL}
[DOM] FAILED_TEXT reads 'Couldn't load coupons' {SPEC}
[COUNT] CARDS_AFTER_FAIL is 0 and STALE_CARDS is 0 -- a failed load replaces the rows, it never leaves stale ones {SPEC}
[REL] STATUS_FAILED equals FAILED_TEXT -- the failure is announced through the polite live region {BL}

[REL] the accessible names of the ten copy buttons in TAB_NAMES are pairwise different -- each names its coupon, none is just 'Click to copy' {BL}
[COUNT] FOCUS_VISIBLE is true for every control {BL}
[DOM] the 'Coupon copied successfully' notification appears after Enter on the focused copy button {SPEC}
[TOUCH] BTN_W and BTN_H are each at least 24 CSS px at 375 px {BL}

[REL] WIDGET_CONTROLS holds only the 'All promotion coupons' link and the copy buttons {SPEC}
[REL] PAGE_CONTROLS is empty {SPEC}
[REL] neither WIDGET_TEXT nor PAGE_TEXT contains 'Apply to cart', a customer-audience badge such as 'Everyone' or 'Personal' or a filter label {SPEC}
[REL] neither text contains the mockup caption of the obsolete design {SPEC}

[REL] ACT_URL ends with /company/my-customers/<the customer id>/activities {SPEC}
[REL] ACT_H1 is not the host Page not found heading and no error boundary is displayed {SPEC}
[REL] BUYER_URL equals {{FRONT_URL}}/account/dashboard {OBSERVED}
[REL] BUYER_SAW is false {BL}

[REL] the bound code is not in ALL_CODES and not in WIDGET_CODES, compared without regard to case -- the page under the bound organization's own name hides it (PO-QUESTION whether it should) {SPEC}
[REL] BOUND_STATE is the applied state and BOUND_DISCOUNT is true -- the bound organization's buyer can redeem it {OBSERVED}
[REL] OTHER_ERROR is the invalid-code text of the card and OTHER_DISCOUNT is false -- another organization is refused {OBSERVED}
[NETWORK] no 5xx on any request of the case {SPEC}

[REL] SHOWN_DATE is not later than LAST_DAY -- the card never shows a day on which the code no longer works {SPEC}
[REL] BROWSER_OFFSET_H is not 0 -- the precondition: a zone in which the UTC date and the local date can differ {OBSERVED}
[NETWORK] no 4xx/5xx on /graphql/sales-rep and no GraphQL errors[] in any salesRepCoupons response during the case {SPEC}
